      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUMP ON KNOTS (2) has a strong record this trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (22.02) in a Novice race over 381m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. TOOTH KEEPING (1) was on speed throughout but collided in the run and finished second (22.18) at this track over 381m in a Novice race. Harder here but expected to measure up. MR. BARVAL (5) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 21.94 beating Tide Is High. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. One of the leading chances again. BAND FOR BAND (8) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
